        <li>First-year Civitas students are required to take FYS 110, FYS 111 is not required as this learning content is fulfilled through the Civitas curriculum.</li>
        <li>Civitas 110 and 200 fulfill the Humanities, Christian Tradition and Humanities, Literature requirements of SOPHIA.</li>
    </ul>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 40px; line-height: 1.6;">
